<view class="page ops-page page-enter">
  <view class="ops-hero"><view class="ops-kicker">可追踪·不直接覆盖</view><view class="ops-title">操作日志与纠正</view><view class="ops-subtitle">查看谁在什么时候做了什么。发现错误时创建纠正工单，不会直接覆盖原业务记录。</view></view>
  <view class="correction-panel" wx:if="{{selected}}"><view class="ops-card-title">申请纠正：{{selected.title}}</view><view class="ops-card-meta">{{selected.actor}} · {{selected.createdText}}</view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">什么地方错了</view><textarea value="{{reason}}" bindinput="inputReason" maxlength="1200" placeholder="例如：家长要求改周五，但课程被改到了周四" /></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">期望纠正后的结果</view><textarea value="{{expectedResult}}" bindinput="inputExpected" maxlength="1200" placeholder="请写明正确的时间、老师或工单状态" /></view><view class="ops-actions"><button class="ops-secondary" bindtap="cancelCorrection">取消</button><button class="ops-danger" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="submitCorrection">创建纠正工单</button></view></view>
  <view class="ops-section"><view class="ops-section-title">最近操作</view><view class="ops-card" wx:for="{{operations}}" wx:key="id"><view class="ops-card-head"><view><view class="ops-card-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="ops-card-meta">{{item.actor}} · {{item.createdText}}</view><view class="ops-card-meta">{{item.module}} / {{item.action}}</view></view><view class="ops-badge">{{item.actorRoleText}}</view></view><view class="meta-row" wx:for="{{item.meta}}" wx:key="key">{{item.key}}：{{item.value}}</view><view class="ops-actions" wx:if="{{canRequestCorrection}}"><button class="ops-secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="startCorrection">发现错误，申请纠正</button></view></view><view class="empty-state" wx:if="{{showEmpty}}">暂无可查看的操作日志</view></view>
</view>
